{#
    References to several other records — the `multijoin` alias.

    IT DELEGATES TO `checkboxgroup` for the reason `entity` delegates to `select`: picking several
    records and ticking several options are one act, and the options are already resolved before
    the fragment runs. A `<select multiple>` was the alternative and lost — it hides that more
    than one choice is possible, and it needs a modifier key that nobody is told about.

    TWO OF THE THREE ALIASES ON THIS KEY NEVER ARRIVE HERE. `joinbidirectional` is not writable
    at all — `JoinBidirectionalType::toDatabase()` is an empty method, the core ignores every
    write — and `virtualjoin` is computed. Both are sent to `readonly` and are shown instead.
#}
